WEBGROWTH SOLUTIONS — SERVICES

WebGrowth Solutions is a small web development company that helps businesses establish and improve their online presence.

SERVICE 1: BUSINESS WEBSITE

A business website is designed for companies that need a professional online presence.

Typical features:
- Home page
- About page
- Services page
- Contact page
- WhatsApp/contact integration
- Responsive mobile design
- Basic SEO setup

Typical project duration:
1 to 3 weeks.

Best suited for:
- Local businesses
- Restaurants
- Gyms
- Clinics
- Professional services
- Small and medium-sized businesses


SERVICE 2: E-COMMERCE WEBSITE

An e-commerce website allows businesses to sell products online.

Typical features:
- Product catalogue
- Product details
- Shopping cart
- Checkout
- Order management
- Customer accounts
- Payment gateway integration
- Responsive design

Typical project duration:
3 to 6 weeks.

Best suited for:
- Retail businesses
- Clothing brands
- Local product businesses
- Small online stores
- Businesses planning to start selling online


SERVICE 3: WEB APPLICATION

A web application is a customized software system built around a specific business requirement.

Examples:
- Customer management systems
- Booking systems
- Admin dashboards
- Inventory systems
- Internal business tools
- Custom portals

Typical project duration:
4 to 12 weeks depending on complexity.

Best suited for:
- Growing businesses
- Startups
- Businesses with custom software requirements


SERVICE 4: WEBSITE MAINTENANCE

Website maintenance includes ongoing technical support and updates.

Possible activities:
- Content updates
- Bug fixes
- Performance improvements
- Security updates
- Minor design changes
- Technical troubleshooting

Maintenance can be provided as a monthly service.


SERVICE 5: BASIC SEO

Basic SEO helps improve the technical and on-page search visibility of a website.

Possible activities:
- Page title optimization
- Meta description optimization
- Heading optimization
- Basic keyword optimization
- Image optimization
- Basic technical SEO

SEO results are not guaranteed and depend on competition, website quality, content and other factors.


GENERAL BUSINESS POLICY

WebGrowth Solutions focuses primarily on small and medium-sized businesses.

Projects are evaluated based on:
- Requirement fit
- Budget
- Timeline
- Business type
- Technical feasibility

Custom requirements may require additional discussion before a final quotation is provided.
